A,
A,EQ6 input file name= swxrcaft.6i,
A,Description= 'React a Ca/Na ion exchanger with flowing seawater',
A,Version level= 8.0,
A,Revised 08/04/97    Revisor= T.J. Wolery,
A,This is part of the EQ3/6 Test Case Library,
A,,
A,  React a Ca/Na ion exchanger with seawater in a fluid-centered,
A,flow-through open system. The exchanger composition in equilibrium with the,
A,fresh seawater is nearly saturated with Na. The reactant exchanger is,
A,nearly saturated with Ca.,
A,,
A,  Purpose: to test the generic ion exchange modeling capability in the case,
A,of an exchanger reactant.,
A,,
A,  This problem has no actual redox aspect. The oxygen fugacity was set to,
A,---,
